  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Cyber security roles ask for a base of networking and operating system knowledge, scripting, security concepts and careful habits, and the legal way to practise is on your own machines or authorised labs.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
